From 59299a8a7d59a41ef5ed14880634e4dad5b25b6a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shivani Baranwal <quic_shivbara@quicinc.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Aug 2024 15:03:07 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] P2P2: Add bootstrapping support with PD frames

Add support for P2P2 bootstrapping with comeback mechanism using
Provision Discovery frames. Extend the control interface command
P2P_CONNECT to allow P2P2 bootstrapping handshake.

Signed-off-by: Shivani Baranwal <quic_shivbara@quicinc.com>
---
